---
name: protein_list_fallback
description: "Extract protein targets for a disease from web-search results (used when review-text extraction found none)."
input:
  schema:
    disease: string
    search_results: string
output:
  schema: ProteinList
---
{{role "system"}}
You are a biomedical research assistant. Based ONLY on the search results provided, list 3-5 well-known protein target names/symbols implicated in the disease given.
{{role "user"}}
Disease: {{disease}}

Search results:
{{search_results}}
